### Outbound Proxy

Profilarr has no proxy setting of its own. It follows these standard variables for everything it fetches: database updates from GitHub, notifications, TMDB, and announcements.

<div class="mb-5">
<AdaptiveList
	data={envProxy}
	columns={envColumns}>
	{#snippet cell(row, col)}
		{#if col.key === 'variable'}
			<span class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-2">
				<code>{row.variable}</code>
				{#if row.dockerOnly}<Badge color="success" variant="subtle" pill>Docker only</Badge>{/if}
			</span>
		{:else if col.key === 'default'}
			{#if row.defaultHref}<a href={row.defaultHref} title={row.default}><code>{row.defaultLabel}</code></a>{:else if row.default}<code>{row.default}</code>{:else}<span class="text-text-muted">Not set</span>{/if}
